                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "42a5cf50-9865-3dff-be65-4927b5cb949b",
                                        "entry_id": "15cca5ca-193b-3d8a-a695-4497176aced5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vitality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cfce1b8-6709-3d9d-ac2e-c1745e37d072",
                                        "entry_id": "15cca5ca-193b-3d8a-a695-4497176aced5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A naive person; a simpleton."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c39824b-bc9b-4cbc-8b2c-b044a909c1ec",
                                                "sense_id": "6cfce1b8-6709-3d9d-ac2e-c1745e37d072",
                                                "text": "Look at the sap mowing our lawn while we pretend our own lawnmower is broken."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6feb7d0-e4ae-49f3-885e-10a21768da51",
                                                "sense_id": "6cfce1b8-6709-3d9d-ac2e-c1745e37d072",
                                                "text": "\"Or trying to reproduce it.\"\n\"The Mafia wouldn't do that.\"\n\"Don't be a sap,\" Hiro says. \"Of course they would.\"\nY.T. seems miffed at Hiro."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfef7617-921f-417b-a99a-5e71a62ac51b",
                                                "sense_id": "6cfce1b8-6709-3d9d-ac2e-c1745e37d072",
                                                "text": "She said I'm such a sap, I'm such a jerk / Can't I ever forget the way that we are / Spend all your time with your eyes on the ground / Looking for the stars"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10607fd8-a7df-37bd-86c7-1ee9fa1e9424",
                                        "entry_id": "22e0d3c1-dc19-310b-8cc6-7b404388fad8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To drain, suck or absorb from (a tree, etc.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcca96c0-6d72-3c6f-b1f8-bf983d25ab4b",
                                        "entry_id": "22e0d3c1-dc19-310b-8cc6-7b404388fad8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exhaust the vitality of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d454261-a98c-48bc-bfd6-cafa556b60b9",
                                                "sense_id": "fcca96c0-6d72-3c6f-b1f8-bf983d25ab4b",
                                                "text": "Somewhat he knoweth of art magical, yet useth not that art; for it sappeth the life and strength, nor is it held worthy that a Demon should put trust in that art, but rather in his own might and main."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "447ecbe2-a8a0-42bb-ac42-225ac4dc587a",
                                                "sense_id": "fcca96c0-6d72-3c6f-b1f8-bf983d25ab4b",
                                                "text": "While Tuchel will be delighted with the way his players responded, there will be concern at how much the energy-sapping 120 minutes has taken out of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8311b32e-3eee-447b-8ee8-3812245af331",
                                                "sense_id": "fcca96c0-6d72-3c6f-b1f8-bf983d25ab4b",
                                                "text": "Alcaraz flew out of the blocks in the first-to-10 match tie-break of the deciding set, sapping every last bit of Sinner's energy before sealing victory with a remarkable running forehand winner that fizzed down the line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "546ead83-a874-3ad7-b031-ad8a5e4893b7",
                                        "entry_id": "22de48d2-e0cf-3b8c-918d-9e9f29aab36c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short wooden club; a leather-covered hand weapon; a blackjack."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37348d9f-59d7-44cb-972a-8dd4d3cbf769",
                                                "sense_id": "546ead83-a874-3ad7-b031-ad8a5e4893b7",
                                                "text": "I risk my whole future, the hatred of the cops and Eddie Mars' gang. I dodge bullets and eat saps."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31540eea-a742-306c-8bb6-3db9ff713d3d",
                                        "entry_id": "bc5c02fe-5363-3d9c-9883-2cdc339650b1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To strike with a sap (with a blackjack)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ac545b0-604f-4059-9f2d-a816596d7c0c",
                                                "sense_id": "31540eea-a742-306c-8bb6-3db9ff713d3d",
                                                "text": "[A]s he passes the mouth of a narrow alley two men step out quickly. One of them saps Marlowe expertly — they drag him out of sight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3697593a-ba5b-4351-966b-b0b4f38e7f46",
                                                "sense_id": "31540eea-a742-306c-8bb6-3db9ff713d3d",
                                                "text": "And when he had me up there he would sap me again and I wouldn't remember anything that happened in between the two sappings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0863277b-4685-38f4-af6a-37844dc22590",
                                        "entry_id": "ffecdd8e-a039-343f-b962-81badc239192",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A narrow ditch or trench made from the foremost parallel toward the glacis or covert way of a besieged place by digging under cover of gabions, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b3425c5b-fec8-3fa7-b52d-cdfc6f15a802",
                                        "entry_id": "4f74d99b-0247-33fc-b3d4-09e5631dfedf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To subvert by digging or wearing away; to mine; to undermine; to destroy the foundation of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "609eb7f1-0e1c-4fed-bd77-700d2aea1b6a",
                                                "sense_id": "b3425c5b-fec8-3fa7-b52d-cdfc6f15a802",
                                                "text": "Nor safe their dwellings were, for sapped by floods, / Their houses fell upon their household gods."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ff22765-8644-33dd-8a94-ad342af4e891",
                                        "entry_id": "4f74d99b-0247-33fc-b3d4-09e5631dfedf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pierce with saps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "688e5416-0a01-386f-9c3c-bb3c56508198",
                                        "entry_id": "4f74d99b-0247-33fc-b3d4-09e5631dfedf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make unstable or infirm; to unsettle; to weaken."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "625a1b22-ec99-4d12-a52e-18c933a50f25",
                                                "sense_id": "688e5416-0a01-386f-9c3c-bb3c56508198",
                                                "text": "Ring out the grief that saps the mind[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "143a912a-5f64-3315-91fa-4ad2012265d4",
                                        "entry_id": "4f74d99b-0247-33fc-b3d4-09e5631dfedf",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To gradually weaken."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e50b754e-167e-4a1c-9570-01a9230c843f",
                                                "sense_id": "143a912a-5f64-3315-91fa-4ad2012265d4",
                                                "text": "to sap one’s conscience"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba71683e-7900-4d8e-ada1-b9c666fcddc9",
                                                "sense_id": "143a912a-5f64-3315-91fa-4ad2012265d4",
                                                "text": "he saps my energy"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f537f65-87d5-3878-bf5e-f0450f3ed18a",
                                        "entry_id": "4f74d99b-0247-33fc-b3d4-09e5631dfedf",
